! $Curve
!    Text:              Label
! 
!    $$Interpolated:    If points are not consecutive, the curve is to
!                       assume a straigt line between two adjacent points.
! 
!    $$Stepped:         If points are not consecutive, the level between two
!                       adjacent points shall remain at that of the first point
!                       up until the second point.
! 
!    $$CurveData:       Each point defined for the curve consists of
!                       an input level and an output level in 0-255 values.
!                       The format is input@output.
!    $$CurvePoint       All curve points in 0-100 full precision values
 
