!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! Submasters
! $$InhibSubm     Submaster is inhibitive
! $$EffectSub     Submaster is effect mode
! $$Dwell         Dwell time
!                 Dwell type (0=timed, 1=manual, 2=hold)
! $$LTP           LTP, default=HTP
! $$Independent
! $$Exclusive
! $$IntensityMaster
! $$Master        Slider mode, see comment, default=Master
! $$UnmarkZero    default=Off
! $$Phantom       default=Off
! $$Restore       1=Minimum, default=Background
! $$Priority      Foreground/Background, default=4/4
! $$Stomp         see comment
! $$Exclude       see comment
! $$FXOffZero     0=Off, default=On
! $$Control       number, fader mode, min, max, buttons 1-3 id/arg
 
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! Presets (USITT ASCII groups)
 
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! Palettes
! Palettes can have CHAN, PARAM and TEXT secondaries
! $IntensPalette palette_number
! $FocusPalette  palette_number
! $ColorPalette  palette_number
! $BeamPalette   palette_number
 
$ColorPalette 8
   $$Param  13 12@255 13@100 14@91 48@255 
   $$Param  14 12@255 13@100 14@91 48@255 
 
$ColorPalette 10
   Text sky blue
   $$Param  101 12@0 13@255 14@248 48@214 208@0 671@0 
   $$Param  102 12@0 13@255 14@248 48@214 208@0 671@0 
   $$Param  103 12@0 13@255 14@248 48@214 208@0 671@0 
   $$Param  104 12@0 13@255 14@248 48@214 208@0 671@0 
 
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! Groups
! 
! $Group n             Channel group n
! 
!    Text              Group label
! 
!    $$ChanList        List of channels in group
!    $$SubChanList     Subgroup list (if present)
 
$Group 1
   $$ChanList      1     2     3     4
 
$Group 2
   $$ChanList     41    42    43    44
 
$Group 4
   $$ChanList     11    12    13    14
 
$Group 10
   $$ChanList    101   102   103   104
 
$Group 101
   $$ChanList    101   102   103   104
 
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! Fader Definitions
! $FaderDef        fader number
! 
! $$Target         type, id
! $$Locked        default=No
! $$LocalMapping  default=use target mapping
! $$NoDiscrete    default=Discrete Instance
! $$Control       number, fader mode, min, max, buttons 1-3 id/arg
! $$ChanFilter    list of channels
! $$ParamFilter   list of parameters
! $$CatFilter     list of parameter categories
! $$CuelistFilter list of cuelists
! $$EffectFilter  list of effects
! $$ManualFilter  default=Off
! (other definitions are dependent from target type)
 
$FaderDef 10003
   $$Target CL 1
   $$GoFromLast 3 ! Restore
   $$Control 1 0 0 100 52 0 818 0 817 0
   $$Control 2 4 0 100 822 0 822 0 822 0
 
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
! Effect Definitions
! 
! $Effect         Number
! Text            Effect Label
! 
! $$Type          1=Linear 2=Focus 3=Color 4=Absolute 5=StepBased
! $$Duration      Time, 0=Infinite (default)
! $$Cycles        Count 1-9999, default=Infinite
! $$Negative
! $$Bounce
! $$Reverse
! $$Build
! $$Alternate
! $$BounceChan    Bounce Channels
! $$Random        Random Group
! $$RandomRate    Percentage Range
! $$Grouping      Count, 0=Spread (default)
! $$Trail         Percentage, 0=Even (default)
! $$Scale         for Linear/Focus/Color Effects, default=25
! $$Entry         Mode (default=Size Fade), Time (default=Cue/Sub)
! $$Cascade       default=Immediate
! $$Exit          Mode (default=Size Fade), Time (default=Cue/Sub)
! $$ExitCascade   default=Immediate
! $$Dimensions    Linear/Focus/Color Effects: Table Depth 1-3
! $$ParamList     Effect Parameter List
! $$StepTimes     Non-Step Effects: Index, Time, Dwell, StepTime (in msec)
! $$Action        Absolute Effects: Index, Time, Dwell, Level
! $$Step          Step Effects: Index, Step/In/Dwell/Decay Time, On/Off Level
! $$Data          Linear/Focus/Color Effects: Index, Level[s]
 
